  message: "Shipped as PR (merged to dev as 4ebcf0f79). New hypergumbo_lang_rust_analyzer.graceful_degrade.try_analyze_with_rust_analyzer packages the 'use rust-analyzer vs fall through to rust.py' decision as a single-expression call: returns (symbols, edges) on the happy path and None on any of the three WI-nohah fall-through conditions (RustAnalyzerNotInstalled / RustAnalyzerInvocationFailed / RustAnalyzerNoOutput from invoke, or DecodeError from translate). Fall-through log messages deduplicate per (exception_type, workspace) so repeated calls on one workspace log once but distinct workspaces each get their own emission. invoke/translate/log are all injectable. 9 tests, 100% coverage. Unblocks WI-duzul Slice C — the analyzer-registry wrapper calls this helper per workspace and None drives the fall-through to rust.py. Provenance-marker concern from the description is explicitly scoped to Slice C (analyzer-registry wrapper will set symbol.origin='scip' or 'tree-sitter-rust' accordingly); this item delivers the decision primitive."  # 4b28
